BT /B 16 Tf 54 790 Td (Burnout Insight - Repository Guide) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 765 Td (A simple guide to the purpose, features, structure, scoring, privacy, and development) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 750 Td (workflow of the Burnout Insight website.) Tj ET
BT /B 16 Tf 54 729 Td (1. Project purpose) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 704 Td (Burnout Insight is a standalone English website for educational reflection on exhaustion and) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 689 Td (workplace pressure. It runs in a browser and does not require an account, server, or) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 674 Td (database.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 653 Td (The project helps a person understand patterns in personal and work-related exhaustion and) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 638 Td (provides practical, non-clinical suggestions for workplace concerns and recovery.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 617 Td (The site is not a medical diagnostic tool.) Tj ET
BT /B 16 Tf 54 596 Td (2. What the tool can do) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 571 Td (- Ask 25 mixed questions: 13 CBI exhaustion questions and 12 workplace questions.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 550 Td (- Update Personal burnout and Work-related burnout meters during the assessment.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 529 Td (- Use Enter to submit a selected answer and move to the next question.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 508 Td (- Show lower, elevated, and higher ranges with matching colors.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 487 Td (- Provide Immediate support check-ins for workload, control, coworker tension, or) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 472 Td (exhaustion.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 451 Td (- Save complete reports and all question/answer details in browser records.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 430 Td (Review, delete, restore, and export saved reports.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 409 Td (- Create a formatted report that can be saved as a real PDF from the browser print dialog.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 388 Td (- Provide a private seven-day progress plan.) Tj ET
BT /B 16 Tf 54 367 Td (3. Main user flow) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 342 Td (- Choose Find my pattern for the full assessment, or Get immediate help for a focused) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 327 Td (check-in.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 306 Td (- Answer each question. Select an option and press Enter, or click Continue.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 285 Td (- Review the colored meters, explanations, and suggested next steps.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 264 Td (- Open Records to review saved reports and select Create PDF report.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 243 Td (- Choose Save as PDF in the browser print dialog.) Tj ET
BT /B 16 Tf 54 222 Td (4. Repository structure) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 197 Td (- website/index.html - generated standalone browser file.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 176 Td (- website/app.js - pages, survey flow, meters, records, reports, exports, and interactions.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 155 Td (- website/core.js - questions, answer scales, scoring rules, and sources.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 134 Td (- website/style.css - layout, colors, responsive design, and print styling.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 113 Td (- website/build.py - combines the source files into index.html.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 92 Td (docs/Burnout_Insight_Repository_Guide.md - source version of this guide.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 71 Td (docs/Burnout_Insight_Repository_Guide.pdf - PDF version of this guide.) Tj ET
endstream
