stream
BT /B 16 Tf 54 784 Td (5. Scoring design) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 759 Td (- CBI answer choices become 100, 75, 50, 25, or 0.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 738 Td (- The personal score averages P01-P06.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 717 Td (- The work-related CBI score averages W01-W07. W07 is reverse-scored because it asks about) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 702 Td (energy during leisure time.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 681 Td (- The 12 workplace questions cover Workload, Control, Reward, Community, Fairness, and) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 666 Td (Values.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 645 Td (- Severity bands are Lower below 34, Elevated from 34 through 66, and Higher at 67 or above.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 630 Td (These are presentation bands, not clinical cutoffs.) Tj ET
BT /B 16 Tf 54 609 Td (6. Records, privacy, and reports) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 584 Td (- Records stay in browser local storage. No account or server upload is required.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 563 Td (- Saved reports include scores, workplace analysis, recommendations, report date/time, and) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 548 Td (response details.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 527 Td (- PDF export uses the browser print dialog because a standalone page cannot silently create) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 512 Td (a valid PDF without a PDF library or server.) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 491 Td (- Browser storage can be cleared, and reports may contain sensitive personal reflections.) Tj ET
BT /B 16 Tf 54 470 Td (7. Development workflow) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 445 Td (- After editing app.js, core.js, or style.css, run: python website/build.py) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 424 Td (- Run scoring tests: node Burnout_Insight_ALL_IN_ONE/tests/scoring.test.cjs) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 403 Td (- Check JavaScript syntax: node --check website/app.js) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 382 Td (- Synchronize the generated index.html before publishing.) Tj ET
BT /B 16 Tf 54 361 Td (8. Important limitation) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 336 Td (- Burnout Insight is an educational reflection tool. It cannot determine whether a person) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 321 Td (has burnout or another health condition and should not replace qualified professional) Tj ET
BT /R 10 Tf 54 306 Td (support.) Tj ET
endstream
